fountains, pick-axing walls, etc). Simply diluting a potion will most
of the time not dry up a fountain, but getting Excalibur will always
do so. So don't dip for Excalibur in MineTown. There are 4 nice
fountains on the Oracle level if you haven't found any others earlier
in the main dungeon, and the Oracle doesn't care about her founts.

